"December and January, when winter is at its severest, there are compensating "
"bright sun and brilliant views. As with most of the trekking areas in Nepal, "
"the best time to visit are during spring and autumn. Spring is the time for "
"rhododendrons while the clearest skies are found after the monsoon in "
"October and November. However, Nepal can be visited the whole year round. "
"Average temperatures and rainfall during peak summer and winter in three "
"most popular tourist areas:"
msgstr ""

